# 数据驱动状态配置

数据驱动状态配置（Data-Driven State Configuration）将状态机的定义从代码中分离出来，以 JSON、ScriptableObject 或其他数据格式描述状态、转换和参数，在运行时动态加载并构建状态机。这让策划可以不修改代码地调整 NPC 行为，也使多个 NPC 变体共享相同的状态机框架但有不同的参数成为可能。

## 核心概念

数据驱动状态配置的本质是**将「状态机的结构」与「执行引擎」分离**：执行引擎是通用的代码，状态机结构由数据文件定义。这与传统方式（状态机结构硬编码在类中）的区别是：

| 对比维度   | 硬编码状态机         | 数据驱动状态机         |
| ---------- | -------------------- | ---------------------- |
| 添加新状态 | 修改代码，重新编译   | 修改配置文件           |
| 策划调参   | 需要程序员介入       | 策划直接编辑数据       |
| 多变体 NPC | 复制类，维护多份代码 | 多份配置文件，同一引擎 |
| 热重载     | 不支持               | 可以在运行时重载       |
| 调试可视化 | 依赖代码实现         | 可基于数据文件生成图   |

## 数据驱动架构流程

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[JSON / SO 配置文件] --> B[StateMachineBuilder\n解析器]
    B --> C[RuntimeFSM\n执行引擎]
    C --> D[游戏对象]
    E[文件监听器] --> |文件变更| B
    F[Blackboard\n共享数据] <--> C
    G[ActionRegistry\n行动注册表] --> B
    H[ConditionParser\n条件解析器] --> B
```

数据驱动架构的核心层次：配置文件描述结构，解析器将配置转换为运行时对象，执行引擎驱动游戏对象行为，文件监听器实现热重载。

## JSON 格式状态配置

一个完整的 JSON 状态机定义示例：

```json
{
  "name": "BasicEnemyFSM",
  "initialState": "Patrol",
  "blackboardDefaults": {
    "alertLevel": 0.0,
    "lastKnownPlayerPos": null,
    "healthPercent": 1.0
  },
  "states": [
    {
      "name": "Patrol",
      "onEnter": ["PlayAnimation:Patrol_Walk", "SetNavSpeed:2.0"],
      "onExit": ["StopAnimation"],
      "transitions": [
        {
          "to": "Alert",
          "condition": "alertLevel > 0.3",
          "priority": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alert",
      "onEnter": ["PlaySound:alert_sound", "SetNavSpeed:1.5"],
      "onExit": [],
      "transitions": [
        {
          "to": "Chase",
          "condition": "alertLevel > 0.8",
          "priority": 10
        },
        {
          "to": "Patrol",
          "condition": "alertLevel < 0.1 && stateTime > 3.0",
          "priority": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chase",
      "onEnter": ["PlayAnimation:Run", "SetNavSpeed:4.5"],
      "onExit": [],
      "transitions": [
        {
          "to": "Attack",
          "condition": "distanceToPlayer < 2.0",
          "priority": 10
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

## 配置解析器

将 JSON 配置解析并构建运行时状态机：

```csharp
[Serializable]
public class StateMachineConfig
{
    public string name;
    public string initialState;
    public Dictionary<string, object> blackboardDefaults;
    public List<StateConfig> states;
}

[Serializable]
public class StateConfig
{
    public string name;
    public List<string> onEnter;
    public List<string> onExit;
    public List<TransitionConfig> transitions;
}

[Serializable]
public class TransitionConfig
{
    public string to;
    public string condition;  // 表达式字符串
    public int priority;
}

public class StateMachineBuilder
{
    private ActionRegistry actionRegistry;
    private ConditionParser conditionParser;

    public RuntimeFSM Build(StateMachineConfig config, GameObject owner)
    {
        var fsm = new RuntimeFSM(config.name);
        var blackboard = BuildBlackboard(config.blackboardDefaults);

        foreach (var stateConfig in config.states)
        {
            var state = BuildState(stateConfig, owner, blackboard);
            fsm.AddState(state);
        }

        fsm.Initialize(config.initialState, blackboard);
        return fsm;
    }

    private RuntimeState BuildState(
        StateConfig config,
        GameObject owner,
        Blackboard blackboard)
    {
        var state = new RuntimeState(config.name);

        // 解析 onEnter 行动
        foreach (var actionStr in config.onEnter)
        {
            var action = actionRegistry.Parse(actionStr, owner);
            state.AddEnterAction(action);
        }

        // 解析转换条件
        foreach (var transConfig in config.transitions)
        {
            var condition = conditionParser.Compile(
                transConfig.condition, blackboard);
            state.AddTransition(new RuntimeTransition(
                transConfig.to, condition, transConfig.priority));
        }

        return state;
    }
}
```

## Unity ScriptableObject 方案

在 Unity 中，ScriptableObject 是数据驱动配置的原生方案，比 JSON 有更好的编辑器支持：

```csharp
// 状态配置 ScriptableObject
[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = "FSM/State Config")]
public class StateConfigSO : ScriptableObject
{
    public string stateName;
    public AnimationClip enterAnimation;
    public float moveSpeed = 2f;
    public List<TransitionConfigSO> transitions;

    [Header("自定义行为")]
    public List<StateActionSO> enterActions;
    public List<StateActionSO> updateActions;
    public List<StateActionSO> exitActions;
}

// 转换配置
[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = "FSM/Transition Config")]
public class TransitionConfigSO : ScriptableObject
{
    public StateConfigSO targetState;
    public ConditionSO condition;
    public int priority = 5;
}

// 抽象条件基类（可按需扩展）
public abstract class ConditionSO : ScriptableObject
{
    public abstract bool Evaluate(FSMContext context);
}

// 具体条件实现
[CreateAssetMenu(menuName = "FSM/Conditions/Distance Check")]
public class DistanceCheckCondition : ConditionSO
{
    public string targetBlackboardKey = "PlayerTransform";
    public float maxDistance = 5f;

    public override bool Evaluate(FSMContext context)
    {
        var target = context.Blackboard.Get<Transform>(targetBlackboardKey);
        if (target == null) return false;
        return Vector3.Distance(context.Owner.transform.position,
            target.position) <= maxDistance;
    }
}
```

## 热重载实现

热重载允许在游戏运行时修改配置文件并立即生效，大幅提升迭代效率：

```csharp
public class HotReloadableFSMLoader : MonoBehaviour
{
    private string configFilePath;
    private FileSystemWatcher fileWatcher;
    private RuntimeFSM activeFSM;
    private StateMachineBuilder builder;

    private void Start()
    {
        LoadAndBuildFSM();
        SetupFileWatcher();
    }

    private void SetupFileWatcher()
    {
        fileWatcher = new FileSystemWatcher(
            Path.GetDirectoryName(configFilePath))
        {
            Filter = Path.GetFileName(configFilePath),
            NotifyFilter = NotifyFilters.LastWrite
        };

        fileWatcher.Changed += OnConfigFileChanged;
        fileWatcher.EnableRaisingEvents = true;
    }

    private volatile bool needsReload = false;

    private void OnConfigFileChanged(object sender, FileSystemEventArgs e)
    {
        // 文件系统事件在非主线程触发，设置标志在主线程处理
        needsReload = true;
    }

    private void Update()
    {
        if (needsReload)
        {
            needsReload = false;
            ReloadFSM();
        }

        activeFSM?.Update();
    }

    private void ReloadFSM()
    {
        string currentState = activeFSM?.CurrentStateName;

        LoadAndBuildFSM();

        // 尽量恢复到重载前的状态
        if (currentState != null && activeFSM.HasState(currentState))
            activeFSM.ForceSetState(currentState);

        Debug.Log($"[FSM] Hot-reloaded: now in {activeFSM?.CurrentStateName}");
    }

    private void LoadAndBuildFSM()
    {
        string json = File.ReadAllText(configFilePath);
        var config = JsonUtility.FromJson<StateMachineConfig>(json);
        activeFSM = builder.Build(config, gameObject);
    }
}
```

## 可视化编辑器

数据驱动的终极形态是可视化状态机编辑器，让策划通过拖拽连线编辑状态逻辑：

```csharp
// 编辑器工具：从 JSON 生成状态机可视图（Unity Editor 扩展）
#if UNITY_EDITOR
public class FSMVisualizerWindow : EditorWindow
{
    private StateMachineConfig config;
    private Dictionary<string, Rect> stateRects
        = new Dictionary<string, Rect>();

    private void OnGUI()
    {
        // 绘制状态节点
        foreach (var state in config.states)
        {
            if (!stateRects.ContainsKey(state.name))
                stateRects[state.name] = new Rect(
                    Random.Range(50, 400), Random.Range(50, 300), 120, 40);

            GUI.Box(stateRects[state.name], state.name);
        }

        // 绘制转换箭头
        foreach (var state in config.states)
        {
            foreach (var trans in state.transitions)
            {
                if (stateRects.TryGetValue(state.name, out var fromRect)
                    && stateRects.TryGetValue(trans.to, out var toRect))
                {
                    DrawArrow(fromRect.center, toRect.center, trans.condition);
                }
            }
        }
    }

    private void DrawArrow(Vector2 from, Vector2 to, string label)
    {
        Handles.DrawLine(from, to);
        // 绘制箭头头部和条件标签
        GUI.Label(new Rect(
            (from.x + to.x) / 2, (from.y + to.y) / 2, 200, 20), label);
    }
}
#endif
```

## 小结

数据驱动状态配置将「状态机的结构」从代码中解放出来，让策划能够直接编辑 NPC 行为，实现热重载以加速迭代，支持多变体 NPC 共享框架。实现路径：JSON（轻量、可版本控制）→ ScriptableObject（Unity 原生、编辑器集成）→ 可视化编辑器（最高效但开发成本最高）。选择粒度取决于项目规模和策划需要的控制权。

